farmSec:Label("Runs your character to eggs and carries them home.")
farmSec:Label("Needs at least one area ticked below.")
farmSec:Label("Point your camera down and zoom in - the game only shows")
farmSec:Label("a prompt the camera can see.")
-- Handle kept so the boot block at the end of the file can force this off. The menu
