-- NOTHING RUNS BECAUSE OF A REMEMBERED TICK MARK. The menu persists toggle states and
-- replays them at build time, so a session that ended with Auto Farm on came back with the
-- farm already running the instant the script opened - the character setting off across
-- the map before a safe zone or an area had been chosen. Same mechanism that brought
-- Instant Steal back on while its switch read off.
--
-- So the things that MOVE YOU are forced off here, after the menu has had its say, and the
-- switch is pushed to match. Preferences that only change how the farm behaves once you
-- start it - Rare, Size, Anti-Boss - are left alone; remembering those is useful.
